{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/style/foundation","title":"Global foundation and fonts","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"global-foundation-and-fonts","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Global foundation and fonts"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An app built on "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/style"},{"t":"text","text":" has no "},{"t":"code","text":"styles.css"},{"t":"text","text":". What used to go there"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"falls into three layers, and craft-ts writes the first two for you:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"layer"}],[{"t":"text","text":"written by"}],[{"t":"text","text":"what it holds"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"craft.reset"}],[{"t":"text","text":"craft-ts, on by default"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a modern reset"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"craft.base"}],[{"t":"text","text":"craft-ts, on by default"}],[{"t":"text","text":"colour scheme, focus ring, reduced motion, selection, form accent"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"craft.global"}],[{"t":"text","text":"your app, "},{"t":"code","text":"craftGlobalStyles"}],[{"t":"text","text":"your theme variables on "},{"t":"code","text":":root"},{"t":"text","text":", element defaults ("},{"t":"code","text":"body"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"a"},{"t":"text","text":", …)"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"They come before the component layers. The full order is fixed by the emitter,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"whatever order your modules are imported in:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@layer","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" craft.reset, craft.base, craft.tokens, craft.global,"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"       craft.components, craft.variants, craft.overrides;"}]}],"filename":"","language":"css","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Every layer is named "},{"t":"code","text":"craft.*"},{"t":"text","text":". A third-party stylesheet that arrives unlayered"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"wins over all of them — that is how CSS treats unlayered styles — which is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exactly why one should be rare, deliberate and attested."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-reset","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The reset"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"On by default. It sets "},{"t":"code","text":"box-sizing: border-box"},{"t":"text","text":" everywhere, removes default"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"margins, makes media blocks that never overflow ("},{"t":"code","text":"max-inline-size: 100%"},{"t":"text","text":"), lets"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"form controls inherit the document font, balances headings and avoids orphans"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"in paragraphs ("},{"t":"code","text":"text-wrap"},{"t":"text","text":"), wraps long words ("},{"t":"code","text":"overflow-wrap: anywhere"},{"t":"text","text":") and"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stops mobile browsers from inflating text."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It is written with the typed vocabulary, like any sheet"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"link","href":"https://github.com/craft-ts/craft-ts/blob/main/libs/style/src/lib/global/reset.ts","external":true,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"libs/style/src/lib/global/reset.ts"}]},{"t":"text","text":")."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Turning it off is a deliberate choice:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craftStyle","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ reset: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"false","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-base","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The base"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Also on by default ("},{"t":"code","text":"base: false"},{"t":"text","tex